      <div class="space-y-5 text-base leading-loose">
        <p>I've spent 8 years at <a href="https://www.cloudflare.com" target="_blank" class="text-[#ff5e1f] hover:opacity-80 transition-opacity duration-200 ease-out">Cloudflare</a> growing from Lead Designer to Director, long enough to have built products, built teams, and figured out what actually makes design organisations work. Currently directing design across Security and Performance products, most recently moving designer from AI-curious to AI-native, helping build the processes and culture to get the whole team shipping with AI-assisted workflows.</p>
        <p>Before Cloudflare I spent nearly 5 years at <a href="https://www.geckoboard.com/" target="_blank" class="text-[#1a7a2e] hover:opacity-80 transition-opacity duration-200 ease-out">Geckoboard</a>, joining as the sole designer and building the design function at a SaaS dashboarding tool used by thousands of businesses. Prior to that, product design at <a href="https://www.huddle.com" target="_blank" class="text-[#0089D0] hover:opacity-80 transition-opacity duration-200 ease-out">Huddle</a> an enterprise document collaboration platform where I developed a strong foundation in end-to-end product design.</p>
        <p>I'm passionate about building high-performing design teams and creating the conditions for designers to do their best work.</p>
